      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Prison Act 1995 [Act 537] is amended in subsection 7(1a) by inserting after the words “Prevention of Crime Act 1959 [Act 297]” the words “and the Prevention of Terrorism Act 2015 [Act …]”. Bill"
